Writing samples

We have found that the team members that we like to work with tend to value the written word. What’s an example of writing that you are proud of?  This writing can take a variety of forms, e.g.:

* An email digest or executive summary
* A risk assessment with recommended mitigations
* A summary of the plan of record including key dependencies
* A technical architecture document, design document, qualification report, process improvement training, onboarding document, etc. 

Please submit at least one writing sample (and no more than three) that you feel represents you, providing links if/as necessary. For each sample, please include a sentence or two of context: who was the audience, what was the situation, and what were you trying to achieve?


